    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40287" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quōquō-versus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-um</span></b> ) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quōquō-vorsum</span></b>  (QVOQVEVERSVS,
